    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. one more thing, sometimes they can be really unpredictable in a way that feels almost... mischievous? like they're purposely trying to mess with the staff or playing little games to see how we react. how should staff handle that kind of behavior without losing their cool?",
      "source": "evaluator"
